      "data": {
        "markdown": "# 🪐 What Twilite Is\n\nTwilite lets humans and AI build persistent knowledge as navigable graph structures instead of disposable chats and scattered documents.\n\nInstead of losing ideas inside chat history, folders, tabs, whiteboards, or screenshots, Twilite keeps relationships visible and durable.",
