        "borderRadius": 24
      },
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# 🔎 One Graph, Many Depths\n\nTwilite supports layered understanding.\n\nAt a glance you can hold product identity, major concepts, and high-level structure.\nCloser in, the same graph can reveal implementation details, supporting evidence, semantic relationships, and runtime behavior.\n\nThat lets one graph support onboarding, exploration, authoring, and advanced architecture work.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
